# Single Responsibility Principle

## Core Guidelines
- One purpose per file/module
- Maximum 300 lines per component/service
- Split components when handling multiple domains or mixing UI and business logic

## File Organization
- Components: One component per file
- Services: One service domain per file
- Hooks: One primary function per hook
- Utils: Group related utilities only

## When to Split
1. Component handles multiple unrelated states
2. File mixes UI and business logic
3. Service handles multiple domains
4. File exceeds 300 lines
5. Function has multiple responsibilities

